{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"58cdaebcf9010db5f3b452475a5143a0759529a1099de61c81249739b11c8872","ja":"みんなは、2つに別れて行動をすることに\nまずは、のり子と亜利沙のお話……","zh":"大家决定兵分2路展开行动\n首先是法子和亚利沙的故事……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"aa927ea591e6f8d2613d2d6fa56035219a527f57832d9127d85b3c14652ec545","ja":"すみません、のり子ちゃん。\nありさに付き合っていただいて……。","zh":"对不起，法子。\n还特意陪亚利沙……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8dfb2775e03a17b57a4a472468aca5e26ee08c54a554d2cde9e8985546ebd3c1","ja":"あははっ！　大丈夫、大丈夫。\nせっかくだから大学を楽しんでもらいたかったし……。","zh":"啊哈哈！没关系，没关系的。\n难得来一次，我也希望能让你好好享受大学生活……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5ebe84e8759606ed885495322742407497f020dd993e8a0ba1f432af9616d01e","ja":"なんか、アイドル研究会って新鮮で楽しかったよ。\nみんなにちやほやしてもらったりもして♪","zh":"感觉偶像研究会挺新鲜挺开心的。\n大家还对我百般吹捧呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"746fec2b37e52b82a1bdc74b650a2cb72471fb4b85a97f0f8a1b1b163093b3c7","ja":"ありさも、すっごく楽しかったです！\nアイドルちゃんの深いお話がたくさんできました♪","zh":"亚利沙也觉得非常开心！\n聊了好多关于偶像的深入话题呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"715ea91ce9476555b0ea5762048a8aa62767d84746b122d51e382412dcbed62f","ja":"みんなすっごく熱心だったよね！","zh":"大家真的都超级热情呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"3d1c8b507d1b017601e774bb0eaf048aaba6fd24548686c783602b6c1077c0ad","ja":"あんなに熱中してくれてるんだから、\nアタシももっと頑張らなくちゃって実感しちゃった。","zh":"大家那么投入，\n我也真切地感受到自己必须更加努力才行了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"5ff01483e89e84c684b8c86fb3cf10ea5081c3e1931dc219e3c81d7756ccd645","ja":"はい！　ありさもアイドルちゃんとして、\nみなさんの応援に応えないと……。","zh":"好的！亚利沙也作为偶像，\n必须回应大家的支持才行……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"1a3de55055a7a81ee36c3dd064b1c786f9fc8f8538b0e94affab4f1002d175d3","ja":"あの、ところで……麗花ちゃんたちとの\n待ち合わせ場所って、『広場の噴水』でしたよね？","zh":"那个，话说回来……和丽花她们\n集合的地点，是“广场的喷泉”对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"0c6aac46db0974d26297e7f4942ef49c1c03f5ac01586e63a6a74db6613dd0dd","ja":"ど、どこにあるんでしょう？\nさっきから広場を歩き回ってるのに……。","zh":"到、到底在哪里呢？\n明明从刚才起就在广场上到处找了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1027.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"9507d01d75b76f5b9e733ef7309f037ddbd54c5f044475a60cbb327f87efe477","ja":"そ、そうだよね。おかしいな……\nそれらしいのが見当たらないんだけど……？","zh":"也、也是呢。奇怪了……\n怎么找不到像是那样的东西呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
